      "id": "chord-extensions-9ths-11ths-and-13ths",
      "title": "Chord Extensions: 9ths, 11ths, and 13ths",
      "level": 1,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "**Track:** chords | **Difficulty:** 6/10 | **Time:** ~10 min"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "title": "Overview",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Extensions continue stacking thirds above the seventh, adding colour tones."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "naming",
      "title": "Naming",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "9th = octave + 2nd. 11th = octave + 4th. 13th = octave + 6th. Cmaj9 = Cmaj7 + D. G13 might be voiced G-F-E-B, omitting some tones for playability."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "practice",
      "title": "Practice",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Add extensions one at a time. Maj7 before maj9. Plain 7 before 9. Listen whether the added tone supports or fights the melody."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "voicing",
      "title": "Voicing",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Players drop the 5th or even root, keeping 3rd, 7th, and chosen extensions within hand span."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
