  "quiz_markdown": "### Q1. maj9 includes which interval above root (besides maj7)?\n\n- A) Major 9th\n- B) Minor 9th only\n- C) Perfect 11th without 7th\n- D) Augmented 4th only\n\n**Answer:** A\n\n### Q2. Real-world voicings often omit some chord tones.\n\n**Answer:** True",
